{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":45,"count":42,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L04-2-16\",\"多少\",\"多少\",\"多少\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這些東西一共多少錢？","pinyin":"Zhèxiē dōngxi yígòng duōshǎo qián?","english":"How much do these things cost altogether?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-16","sourceFront":"多少","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他找你多少錢？","pinyin":"Tā zhǎo nǐ duōshǎo qián?","english":"How much change did he give you?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-21","sourceFront":"找錢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"請給我們一杯紅茶、一杯綠茶。請問一共多少錢？","pinyin":"Qǐng gěi wǒmen yì bēi hóngchá, yì bēi lǜchá. Qǐngwèn yígòng duōshǎo qián?","english":"We would to have a cup of black tea and a cup of green tea. How much does that cost altogether?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個蛋糕跟這瓶果汁一共多少錢？","pinyin":"Zhè ge dàngāo gēn zhè píng guǒzhī yígòng duōshǎo qián?","english":"How much do this cake and this bottle of juice cost?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"多(much) + 少(little) → asking 'much or little?' means 'how many/how much'."},{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-23\",\"后面\",\"後（面）\",\"后（面）\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我旁邊有日本同學，前面跟後面都有美國同學。","pinyin":"Wǒ pángbiān yǒu Rìběn tóngxué, qiánmiàn gēn hòumiàn dōu yǒu Měiguó tóngxué.","english":"There are Japanese classmates beside me, and there are American classmates in front and behind.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-23","sourceFront":"後（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"弟弟在門後面。","pinyin":"Dìdi zài mén hòumiàn.","english":"My younger brother is behind the door.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-06","sourceFront":"門","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"後天是我朋友的生日，我想送他一個大蛋糕。","pinyin":"Hòutiān shì wǒ péngyǒu de shēngrì, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā yí ge dà dàngāo.","english":"The day after tomorrow is my friend’s birthday; I want to give him a big cake.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-19","sourceFront":"後天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"後天去呢？","pinyin":"Hòutiān qù ne?","english":"How about the day after tomorrow then?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-1-06\",\"問\",\"問\",\"问\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們可以去問家樂，他非常聰明，我想他懂。","pinyin":"Wǒmen kěyǐ qù wèn Jiālè, tā fēicháng cōngmíng, wǒ xiǎng tā dǒng.","english":"We can ask Jiale; he is very smart. I think he understands it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我們去問老師，也許他可以幫你。","pinyin":"Wǒmen qù wèn lǎoshī, yěxǔ tā kěyǐ bāng nǐ.","english":"Let’s ask the teacher; maybe he can help you.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"老師：你們有問題嗎？ 學生：沒有。謝謝老師。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī: Nǐmen yǒu wèntí ma? Xuéshēng: Méi yǒu. Xièxie lǎoshī.","english":"Teacher: Do you have any questions? Student: No. Thank you, teacher.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-11","sourceFront":"問題","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請問你是臺灣人嗎？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn nǐ shì Táiwān rén ma?","english":"Excuse me, are you Taiwanese?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-09","sourceFront":"請問","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我想走路去一定沒問題。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng zǒulù qù yídìng méi wèntí.","english":"I think it will certainly be okay going there on foot.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請問兩位要紅茶還是綠茶？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn liǎng wèi yào hóngchá háishì lǜchá?","english":"Would you like to have black tea or green tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請給我們一杯紅茶、一杯綠茶。請問一共多少錢？","pinyin":"Qǐng gěi wǒmen yì bēi hóngchá, yì bēi lǜchá. Qǐngwèn yígòng duōshǎo qián?","english":"We would to have a cup of black tea and a cup of green tea. How much does that cost altogether?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"沒問題。","pinyin":"Méi wèntí.","english":"No problem.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"妳好！我是李中明，請問妳叫什麼名字？","pinyin":"Nǐ hǎo! Wǒ shì Lǐ Zhōngmíng, qǐngwèn nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?","english":"Hi, my name is Li Zhongming. May I ask what your name is?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-01","sourceFront":"什麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請問妳是哪國人？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn nǐ shì nǎ guó rén?","english":"May I ask where you are from?","sourceCardId":"B1L01-2-01","sourceFront":"什麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請問我需要吃藥嗎？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn wǒ xūyào chī yào ma?","english":"Do I have to take any medicine?","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"At the 門(door) you open your 口(mouth) to politely 問(ask) directions."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-3-12\",\"冷氣機\",\"冷氣（機）\",\"冷气（机）\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天辦公室的冷氣不冷，可能冷氣機有問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-13","sourceFront":"辦公室","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"冷氣機裡的網子要常拆下來洗，不然可能吹出髒空氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-51","sourceFront":"拆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台灣的夏天很熱，所以很多人的家裡都裝了冷氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-23","sourceFront":"裝","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天天氣實在太熱了，雖然夏天的電費很貴，我還是把冷氣打開了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-12","sourceFront":"實在","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台灣的夏天熱極了，要是房間沒有冷氣，半夜可能會被熱醒，甚至整個晚上睡不著。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-03","sourceFront":"醒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每個月都會清一次冷氣，這樣比較省電，風也比較涼。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-15","sourceFront":"清","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開冷氣時如果能好好利用電扇，房間很快就涼了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-08","sourceFront":"電扇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"冷氣的溫度要是控制得剛好，不但對健康好，也能省點兒電費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-08","sourceFront":"剛好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，有人說夏天開冷氣不如開除溼機，不過有專家表示，它們的功能無法互相取代。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-22","sourceFront":"除溼機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"冷(cold) + 氣(air) + 機(machine) → the cold-air machine: 冷氣機 is an air conditioner."},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-19\",\"系\",\"系\",\"系\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A guiding stroke 丿(slash) organizes tangled strands of fine 糸(silk) into an orderly 系(system)."},{"key":"[\"B2L09-2-10\",\"報告\",\"報告\",\"报告\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上中文課時，老師要我們用中文報告在台灣的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-10","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個週末我得在家做一份報告，不能出去玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-23","sourceFront":"報告","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我是陳老闆的助理，每天得向他報告公司的情況。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-20","sourceFront":"向","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了做這個報告，經理已經跟我們開過三次會了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-26","sourceFront":"開會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師的要求很多，要寫五篇報告、三篇作文，怎麼寫得完？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-02","sourceFront":"要求","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"等我完成期末報告，就要跟同學去韓國旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-04","sourceFront":"完成","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位教授看報告看得很仔細，你可不能亂寫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-09","sourceFront":"仔細","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？昨天晚上沒睡好嗎？ B:嗯。要不是開夜車趕報告， 現在也不會這麼沒精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-36","sourceFront":"嗯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"新聞報告說颱風快來了，出門時得注意安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-02","sourceFront":"颱風","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個週末我過得很充實，不但完成了期末報告，還跟同學去游泳、衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-07","sourceFront":"充實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一份研究報告表示，對陌生環境適應能力越強的人，未來成功的機會也越高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-18","sourceFront":"陌生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的歷史作業寫完了，同時也把明天要報告的古蹟資料準備好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-03","sourceFront":"同時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你寄報告給老師前最好確認一下地址，萬一老師沒收到，到時你就麻煩了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-19","sourceFront":"到時","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上臺報告以前要把資料準備好，以免到時候手忙腳亂的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-37","sourceFront":"上臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師不滿意我們這一組的報告，要我們重做一次。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-55","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天電視臺的氣象報告說今天會下雨，果然一大早就下起雨來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-52","sourceFront":"果然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小王的閱讀報告寫得很精彩，連教授都在課堂上當面誇獎他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-44","sourceFront":"誇獎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-2-19\",\"难过\",\"難過\",\"难过\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我剛買的皮包被小偷偷了，讓我又生氣又難過。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-19","sourceFront":"難過","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"當我難過的時候，最需要的是家人與好友的安慰。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-19","sourceFront":"安慰","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夫妻之間要是缺少了愛情，日子就比較難過下去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-29","sourceFront":"夫妻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他不小心摔壞了新買的手機，因此難過得要命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-14","sourceFront":"摔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L12-1-16\",\"专业\",\"專業\",\"专业\",\"Vs-attr\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒有專業能力的人，想找到好職業是很困難的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-17","sourceFront":"困難","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我相信有專業能力就比較容易找到好工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-20","sourceFront":"相信","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"那場強烈地震發生以後，許多國家的專業人員都來救災，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-22","sourceFront":"救災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個大學生畢業後，都應該為社會貢獻自己的專業能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-27","sourceFront":"貢獻","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爺爺照醫生的專業建議調整飲食，現在健康情況改善了不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-17","sourceFront":"調整","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大學教育的目的，不僅要提高學生的知識水準，還要進一步培養學生的專業能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-14","sourceFront":"進一步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果遇到無法處理的心理問題，最好請專業人員來輔導。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-02","sourceFront":"輔導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學習外國語言時最好能找位專業的老師，好改正自己的錯誤。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-10","sourceFront":"改正","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當外科醫生不容易，不僅要有手術的專業能力，體力也得夠好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-17","sourceFront":"外科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"各行各業都有屬於自己的專業，無法比較誰高誰低。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-10","sourceFront":"專業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她的專業是人工智慧，這個領域的問題可以請教她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-17","sourceFront":"人工智慧","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在已經沒有所謂的鐵飯碗了，有專業技術才有保障。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-19","sourceFront":"鐵飯碗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這位記者專門報導社會新聞，他報新聞的方式相當專業。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-02","sourceFront":"報","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"職業棒球隊在比賽時，會請專業啦啦隊來製造熱鬧氣氛。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-45","sourceFront":"啦啦隊","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16