又甜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-34","sourceFront":"鮮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"鮮奶是做冰淇淋、甜點不可少的東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-33","sourceFront":"鮮奶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這道菜是用新鮮蔬果做的，不僅味道甘甜，對健康也有好處。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-27","sourceFront":"甘甜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個地區不僅沒有地震、颱風，而且天氣好、空氣新鮮，生活環境安全又舒適。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-15","sourceFront":"舒適","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個用活魚做的菜又新鮮又好吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-45","sourceFront":"活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這家超市的水果不但很新鮮，也很便宜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-13","sourceFront":"新鮮","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"每次到了特別的節日，張先生就會送鮮花給太太，真是浪漫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-35","sourceFront":"鮮花","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽買了鮮花來插花，她覺得插花是一門藝術，讓人欣賞到花的美。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-05","sourceFront":"插花","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個農村裡有個小農場，他們生產的鮮奶冰淇淋非常好吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-29","sourceFront":"農場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個甜點的顏色像鮮血一樣，讓我嚇了一跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-41","sourceFront":"鮮血","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這桌喜酒有很多海鮮，但我只能吃魚，其他種類的海鮮都會讓我皮膚紅腫(inflamed)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-48","sourceFront":"海鮮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從我辦公室隔著玻璃往外看，可以看見開滿鮮花的花園。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-09","sourceFront":"隔","